# Go verify before you finish

After changing code under `apps/harness/`, from that directory run:

```bash
go test ./...
go vet ./...
go build -o /tmp/octo-harness ./cmd/harness
```

Fix every failure. Prefer `go test -race ./...` when the change touches goroutines, shared maps, or store concurrency.
